## Context

Child of tracker 0008 (split by raid f9e483: the ticket bundled five sign-off units over ~25 files). Read 0008's body and log for the up-front decisions: `Kind` is a `Literal`, `ACCEPTS` a `frozenset[str]`; one `DEFAULT_ORDER` constant for the cascade; no `detail_url` (no consumer found); contract as data plus a signature, no ABC/Protocol/base class.

Line endings: cli.py, config.py and sources crossref, hal, libgen, scihub, unpaywall, url are CRLF; keep each file's endings, no whole-file diffs.

## Actions
1. Add mypy or pyright (lenient) to the dev group and as a fifth check in `.merge-gate.json` (also in
   `before`), scoped to `src/doifetch/` (0008 Action 6).
2. It passes on the current tree; tighten only as later children land.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `.merge-gate.json` runs the type checker and it passes on the branch
- [ ] Dev-group only: no runtime dependency added
